        {
          "text": "\" 'Choncho muwayeretsa ana a Israeli nʼkudetsedwa kwawo kuti angafe pochita tchimo lowadetsa limene polichita limadetsa malo anga wokhalamo amene ali pakati pawo.' \"",
          "type": "text",
